        "text": "A quota is a limit on the physical quantity of a product that can be imported. At the border gate, twelve thousand sensors are wanted but only eight thousand pass. The four thousand unit gap pushes the price up from three hundred to three hundred thirty pounds. Domestic producers sell more, while Northstar faces higher costs and less choice. It may switch to local suppliers, or pass the increase to customers.",
